.TH MARBOR\-FAVORITES 1 "2026-08-17" "marbor dev" "Marbor Manual"
.SH NAME
marbor\-favorites \- manage your starred model list (P\-A2-06a)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B marbor favorites
[action] [args] [\fIflags\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
manage your starred model list (P\-A2-06a)
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B list
list starred model ids
.TP
.B add <model\-id>
star a model
.TP
.B remove <model\-id>
unstar a model
.SH FLAGS
.TP
.B \-\-server
Admin API base URL (default "http://localhost:8080", env MARBOR_SERVER)
.TP
.B \-\-json
output machine\-readable JSON instead of a human table
.TP
.B \-\-username
admin username, used to log in (env MARBOR_USERNAME)
.TP
.B \-\-password
admin password, used to log in (env MARBOR_PASSWORD)
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmarbor\fR(1)
